T:A Poem
T:------------
T:A tiny spark
T:In pixel art
T:We build a
T:brand new
T:world apart.
T:
T:No internet,
T:No heavy RAM
T:Just LO--
T:and the jam.
T:
T:Black lines,
T:White space.
T:A pocket
T:sized place.
T:
T:Animations
T:breathe life
A: ~ * ~ * ~  | * ~ * ~ * A: . o . o .  | o . o . o 
T:
T:Da Vinci
T:used paint.
T:We use code,
T:Without
T:restraint.
T:
T:12 chars max
T:Is all we
T:ever need,
T:To plant a
T:digital seed
T:
T:So scroll on
T:Brave viewer
T:Through the
T:offline web.
T:
T:Forever.
T:------------
T:Back Home
